    <title>A note on typography</title>
    <id>https://rich.example/site/posts/a-note-on-typography/</id>
    <updated>2022-04-02T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <link href="https://rich.example/site/posts/a-note-on-typography/" rel="alternate"/>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Three rules:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;one typeface is usually enough&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;measure beats size&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;whitespace is not empty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="/img/pixel.png" alt="A diagram" title="the diagram" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Read the classics if you disagree.&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
